The '''Lotho Minor system''' was a [[star system]] in the [[Outer Rim Territories]]' [[Wazta sector]] which contained the [[planet]] [[Lotho Minor]]. It was located on the [[Lutrillian Cross]] [[hyperspace route]].<ref name="BMF 62" />

